# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Book-derived content -- NEVER committed.
#
# The repository holds code and configuration only. The source rulebook is
# commercial, copyrighted material; neither it nor any text extracted from it
# goes into version control. Note this is broader than just the PDF: the
# SQLite database holds the full per-page text, so it is book content rather
# than a build artifact, and the same is true of the vocabulary file and the
# eval gold set derived from the book's own index.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
